      "description": "Measured frames show the drawn microtubule tip separating from its kinetochore during poleward motion: t=9.67 kinetochore_A x=-0.844 vs microtubule_left end -1.583 (gap 0.74); t=11.13 gap 0.66; frames 10.2s/11.2s show a visible break. Attachment is only re-coincident at 13s, so anaphase movement appears to occur while detached.",
