        "no visible gap in any frame while bipolar_attachment relation exists"
      ]
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "S2",
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Chromatid chevrons point equatorward (sister_A apex x=-0.12, arms x=-0.45), so during leftward anaphase motion the arms lead poleward and the kinetochore region trails. Real anaphase-A geometry has kinetochore leading with arms trailing toward the equator. Schematic, but the drawn shape contradicts the direction of travel.",
      "root_cause_stage": "ASSEMBLY",
      "target_objects": [
        "sister_A",
